            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "R Smith"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used homemade pie crust. Rolled one big oversized crust, layed it in the skillet, added the fresh peaches,folded overlap over the peaches. Used dash of nutmeg, no cinnamon dotted with butter. My mom says not to season fresh peaches with cinnamon they have their own spice.",
